docs {
  # GET /course-rating/{id}
  
  Retrieves rating summary and reviews for a published course.
  
  ## HTTP Method & Route
  - **Method:** `GET`
  - **Route:** `/wp-json/tutor/v1/course-rating/:id`
  
  ## Authentication
  - **Public** (`__return_true`). Bearer JWT optional.
  - Guests get a reduced review payload (display name, content, date, rating only).
  - Authenticated callers get the full rating object (including `rating_sum`) and full approved review rows (`comment_author_email` omitted unless the caller may view private user fields).
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
  | `id` | `integer` | **Yes** | Course post ID. |
  
  ## Query Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type | Default | Description |
  | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
  | `offset` | `integer` | `0` | Review list offset. |
  | `limit` | `integer` | `10` | Page size (capped at 100). |
  
  ## Responses
  
  ### 200 OK — guest (reduced reviews)
  ```json
  {
    "code": "tutor_read_rating",
    "message": "Course rating retrieved successfully",
    "data": {
      "rating_count": 8,
      "rating_avg": 4.88,
      "count_by_value": {
        "5": 7,
        "4": 1,
        "3": 0,
        "2": 0,
        "1": 0
      },
      "reviews": [
        {
          "display_name": "Alex",
          "comment_content": "Great course!",
          "comment_date_gmt": "2026-01-10 12:00:00",
          "rating": 5
        }
      ]
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ### 200 OK — authenticated
  ```json
  {
    "code": "tutor_read_rating",
    "message": "Course rating retrieved successfully",
    "data": {
      "rating_count": 8,
      "rating_avg": 4.88,
      "rating_sum": 39,
      "count_by_value": {
        "5": 7,
        "4": 1,
        "3": 0,
        "2": 0,
        "1": 0
      },
      "reviews": [
        {
          "comment_ID": "42",
          "user_id": "14",
          "display_name": "Alex",
          "comment_content": "Great course!",
          "comment_date": "2026-01-10 12:00:00",
          "comment_date_gmt": "2026-01-10 12:00:00",
          "rating": 5
        }
      ]
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ### 404 Not Found
  ```json
  {
    "code": "tutor_read_rating",
    "message": "Course not found",
    "data": {
      "status": 404
    }
  }
  ```
}
